其異志。今此之舉，將行篡弑耳，豈同於往年乎？是以疆場諸將莫不歸赴本朝，內外之士咸願致死，正以移國易主，義不北面以事之也，奈何協同逆圖，當不義之責乎！朝廷坦誠，禎所知也。賊之黨類，猶宥其罪，與之更始，況見機而作邪！」充不納。率兵臨發，謂其妻子曰：「男兒不豎豹尾，終不還也。」及敗歸吳興，亡失道，誤入其故將吳儒家。儒誘充內重壁中，因笑謂充曰：「三千戶侯也。」充曰：「封侯不足貪也。爾以大義存我，我宗族必厚報汝。若必殺我，汝族滅矣。」儒遂殺之。充子勁竟滅吳氏。勁見《忠義傳》。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0331","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0329"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-w098-return-j8shen","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4_A","title":"長史","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return","source_id":"s-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen","quote":"九月，冠軍將軍陳祐留長史沈勁守洛陽，帥衆奔新城。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen:m0012"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w043-return-j8shen:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"長史","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen:m0012","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen","text":"九月，冠軍將軍陳祐留長史沈勁守洛陽，帥衆奔新城。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"陳祐","kind":"person","person_id":"so1_bi5_jha","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"